WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.580
- You recently performed in your hometown,

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.720
so, when you do a show,

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.310
'cause you've had so many hits,

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.600
there's so many things
people wanna hear you sing,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.430
but is there one that
you still love doing?

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.530
Like, is there a favorite song of yours?

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.560
- Well, in reference to
Memphis, playing the show there,

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.659
that was the first time
we played "Selfish."

00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:17.492
- So that made that special.

00:00:17.492 --> 00:00:18.961
- You were there?

00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:19.794
Oh my gosh.

00:00:19.794 --> 00:00:23.654
- I flew there without
having tickets and I got in.

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.555
- Wow.

00:00:24.555 --> 00:00:25.744
- I still have the bracelet on.

00:00:25.744 --> 00:00:26.577
- [Justin] Oh my gosh.

00:00:26.577 --> 00:00:29.520
- Yeah, when I found
out you were performing,

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.890
I literally booked the
flight, booked hotels,

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.210
not knowing I was getting in.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.774
- And that's why we
have careers, thank you.

00:00:35.774 --> 00:00:37.535
(audience applauding)

00:00:37.535 --> 00:00:40.634
- I live in Jersey.
- Did you have a good time?

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:43.470
- Amazing time, I still
have the bracelet on.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.683
I can't take myself to, and-

00:00:44.683 --> 00:00:45.516
- [Justin] Wonderful.

00:00:45.516 --> 00:00:47.220
- And I found out I was
coming here yesterday.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.110
- Did you know he was
gonna drop the new single?

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.790
- Yes, I mean-
- [Kelly] Okay, okay.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:54.270
- All the subliminal
messaging on your TikTok,

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:56.457
we tried to figure it out.
- Little Easter eggs.

00:00:56.457 --> 00:00:57.290
I like it, I like it

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:01.050
- We're like CIA agents, but
yes, it was unbelievable.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:01.890
And I can't wait to-

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.981
- Well, as we say in
Memphis, thanks for coming.

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:04.950
- Thanks for coming.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:05.823
- Unbelievable, I'll do it all over again.

00:01:05.823 --> 00:01:07.167
- Come on back any time you want.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:09.900
- Well, so you did the
new song there, "Selfish",

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.840
but what's one of your favorite,
like I always still love-

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.100
- From the catalog?
- Doing "Miss Independent".

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:15.090
Yeah, I always love doing that song.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.620
- [Justin] You love
doing "Miss Independent"?

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:17.940
- It's my first single
and I don't know why,

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.579
I love it live, I love it Live.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.150
(audience cheering)

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.732
Do you have a favorite?

00:01:22.732 --> 00:01:24.917
- I mean, "Rock Your Body"'s fun still.

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:25.942
♪ Rock your body ♪

00:01:25.942 --> 00:01:26.775
- Yeah, I like that one.
- "Mirrors".

00:01:26.775 --> 00:01:29.580
"Mirrors" is still fun to sing.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:31.500
Although sometimes I'm like,

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.150
why did I write this in this key?

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:34.380
It's very high.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.900
- [Kelly] That's what I say a lot.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.820
- Yeah, that's why I don't go
on stage until like 9:00 PM

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:41.850
- Yeah.

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.627
Your (singing high pitch) isn't there yet?

00:01:43.627 --> 00:01:44.796
- It's not there yet.

00:01:44.796 --> 00:01:45.630
- Not there yet.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:46.980
- [Kelly] What do you,
this is a real question.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.347
- What a great impersonation, by the way.

00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:51.168
(audience laughing)

00:01:51.168 --> 00:01:53.760
- I was trying to do my
falsetto in my head voice,

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.059
and I was like "Don't suck."

00:01:55.059 --> 00:01:56.193
- I enjoyed it.

